{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51785","headline":"潭州（讽楚王之侈） · 徐仲雅","name":"潭州（讽楚王之侈）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里潇湘琴瑟流，因思旧宅在鳌头。\n凿开青帝春风浦，移下嫦娥夜月楼。\n（《永乐大典》五七七○「沙」字韵）（今按：《全唐诗》只有後二句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐仲雅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}